#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:1
#: 961b2fab5b8d4a76a84ac1fc1cb13e58
msgid "Isomorphic Teleop"
msgstr "同构遥操作"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:3
#: 0f1760dd25dd488ba6237cc5929c4c6b
msgid ""
"Master–slave **isomorphic teleop** (同构遥操作) for **Panthera HT** dual-arm: "
"move the master arm in joint space and the slave follows."
msgstr "面向 **Panthera HT** 双臂的主从 **同构遥操作**：在关节空间移动主臂，从臂跟随。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:5
#: 5ffb027b19434674b08d01d154dc7eb3
msgid ""
"**Implemented:** 同构遥操作 via "
"[`drag_teleop_controller`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/drag_teleop_controller) (package name is historical). **Not "
"implemented:** drag teaching (拖动遥操作), trajectory record/playback, or "
"`enter_teach_mode`."
msgstr ""
"**已实现：** 通过 [`drag_teleop_controller`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/drag_teleop_controller) 的同构遥操作（包名是历史遗留）。**未实现：** 拖动示教（拖动遥操作）、轨迹录制/回放，或 "
"`enter_teach_mode`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:7
#: 7f1191adff1c4ba1a680fe64e8bc9ac8
msgid ""
"On the `panthera-ht` `open-deploy-ws` branch, prefer **`./teleop_start.sh`**"
" (see [Panthera HT](12-panthera_ht.md) and that branch README). The launches"
" below match the `drag_teleop_controller` README."
msgstr ""
"在 `open-deploy-ws` 的 `panthera-ht` 分支上，优先使用 **`./teleop_start.sh`**（见 "
"[Panthera HT](12-panthera_ht.md) 及该分支 README）。下列 launch 与 "
"`drag_teleop_controller` README 一致。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:9
#: e5b8bff394394155afafd8241f42d442
msgid ""
