#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:15
#: 6b654f12e13c4b939a712c9c2681078f
msgid ""
"Two launch processes: one `master`, one `slave` (mock or two physical arms)"
msgstr "两个启动进程：一个 `master`、一个 `slave`（mock 或两台实体臂）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:17
#: 10985c0b0d3e40f88f45347b81a076cd
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:19
#: 9925398759b84b09bdad1827725a5e3c
msgid "One controller plugin, two roles:"
msgstr "同一个控制器插件，两种角色："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md
#: bdd286ac8034492abb22c542beb3094d
msgid "Role"
msgstr "角色"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md
#: a1a997f81db94d5b9cb7edb07439317c
msgid "What it does"
msgstr "作用"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md
#: 220c3997c7f24c07b85925473c4c807b
msgid "`master`"
msgstr "`master`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md
#: 3ada6a94d4f24b36bafc3c4fa76ae32a
msgid ""
"Operator side. Gravity compensation so you can move the arm in joint space; "
"publishes mapped joint state."
msgstr "操作者侧。重力补偿，便于在关节空间移动主臂；发布映射后的关节状态。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md
#: ee5d0545b4a9440f96a56e2c89275577
msgid "`slave`"
msgstr "`slave`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md
#: f1496d55d92f441f8e1a211ff8b21cb3
msgid "Follower. Tracks the mapped master joints (optional ruckig smoothing)."
msgstr "从臂。跟踪映射后的主臂关节（可选 ruckig 平滑）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:26
#: 0a1b7df5344d4abdaa5e3fc02fac70da
msgid ""
"Control modes (`mode`): `position` (slave only), `mit`, `effort`. Master-"
"only force feedback (`feedback`): `false`, `position`, `effort`. Joint "
"mapping runs before `teleop_states` is published. Grippers are handled by "
"`adaptive_gripper_controller` (spawned from the same launch)."
msgstr ""
"控制模式（`mode`）：`position`（仅从臂）、`mit`、`effort`。仅主臂的力反馈（`feedback`）：`false`、`position`、`effort`。关节映射在发布"
" `teleop_states` 之前完成。夹爪由同一 launch 拉起的 `adaptive_gripper_controller` 控制。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:28
#: 8ec9f146b78048a2b3b2af7d4ae1cf22
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "准备"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:30
#: 8ad837df69a5480580693b0b8387379b
msgid ""
"cd ~/open-deploy-ws\n"
"colcon build --packages-select drag_teleop_controller --symlink-install\n"
"source install/setup.bash\n"
msgstr ""
"cd ~/open-deploy-ws\n"
"colcon build --packages-select drag_teleop_controller --symlink-install\n"
"source install/setup.bash\n"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:36
#: 8255416f918943d29739aba4d7603bfe
msgid "Mock (no hardware)"
msgstr "Mock（无需硬件）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:38
#: b1be61a7f2b0408085edbb37ac2503c4
msgid "Two terminals:"
msgstr "两个终端："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:40
#: 9857b5defdcb4763964eca058e94a7fa
msgid ""
"# Terminal 1 — master\n"
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=master hardware:=mock_components\n"
"\n"
"# Terminal 2 — slave\n"
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=slave hardware:=mock_components\n"
msgstr ""
"# Terminal 1 — master\n"
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=master hardware:=mock_components\n"
"\n"
"# Terminal 2 — slave\n"
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=slave hardware:=mock_components\n"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:50
#: f3a4dd7080ce46e69c9569467a1e1637
msgid "Check controllers and topics:"
msgstr "检查控制器与话题："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:52
#: 83466a1b4b684a98a4a6dd0d7e990fdd
msgid ""
"ros2 control list_controllers --controller-manager /drag_teleop_master/controller_manager\n"
"# drag_teleop_controller / left_gripper_controller / right_gripper_controller should be active\n"
"\n"
"ros2 topic echo /drag_teleop_master/teleop_states\n"
"ros2 topic echo /drag_teleop_slave/teleop_states\n"
msgstr ""
"ros2 control list_controllers --controller-manager /drag_teleop_master/controller_manager\n"
"# drag_teleop_controller / left_gripper_controller / right_gripper_controller should be active\n"
"\n"
"ros2 topic echo /drag_teleop_master/teleop_states\n"
"ros2 topic echo /drag_teleop_slave/teleop_states\n"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:60
#: 393af3af370445249d0f9b091be63ab5
msgid "Real hardware (Panthera HT)"
msgstr "真机（Panthera HT）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:62
#: 305b522f797145e4a8ea02d933f6fc88
msgid ""
"Prefer `./teleop_start.sh` on the `panthera-ht` branch. Launch file and "
"argument names below match the package README. Default `robot` is "
"`panthera_ht`. Use `hardware:=real` (or `real_usb`)."
msgstr ""
"在 `panthera-ht` 分支上优先使用 `./teleop_start.sh`。下列 launch 文件与参数名与软件包 README "
"一致。默认 `robot` 为 `panthera_ht`。真机用 `hardware:=real`（或 `real_usb`）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:64
#: 2b5aaddb9a664394a43cd860c88cb672
msgid ""
"# Master (low-stiffness, gravity-compensated)\n"
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=master hardware:=real mode:=effort \\\n"
"  hardware_control_mode:=effort \\\n"
"  hardware_gripper_kp:=\"1e-5\" hardware_gripper_kd:=\"1e-5\"\n"
"\n"
"# Slave (MIT follow)\n"
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=slave hardware:=real mode:=mit\n"
msgstr ""
"# Master (low-stiffness, gravity-compensated)\n"
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=master hardware:=real mode:=effort \\\n"
"  hardware_control_mode:=effort \\\n"
"  hardware_gripper_kp:=\"1e-5\" hardware_gripper_kd:=\"1e-5\"\n"
"\n"
"# Slave (MIT follow)\n"
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=slave hardware:=real mode:=mit\n"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:76
#: 64a77ccd67e34b15a1a83b416fa80463
msgid ""
"Optional master with external-effort feedback: add `feedback:=effort` (see "
"README)."
msgstr "可选：主臂加外部力矩反馈，增加 `feedback:=effort`（见 README）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:78
#: 91f680bed3794c4d85fcd33a2b499e06
msgid "Mode switching"
msgstr "模式切换"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:80
#: ad1a411860bd451aab7f7b1e939339ba
msgid "Custom services, not `std_srvs/Trigger`:"
msgstr "自定义服务，不是 `std_srvs/Trigger`："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:82
#: b3849fb9d0824f629feafd077532afae
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"ros2 service call /drag_teleop_master/teleop_mode \\\n"
"  drag_teleop_controller/srv/TeleopMode \"{mode: effort}\"\n"
"ros2 service call /drag_teleop_master/teleop_feedback \\\n"
"  drag_teleop_controller/srv/TeleopFeedback \"{mode: position}\"\n"
msgstr ""
"ros2 service call /drag_teleop_master/teleop_mode \\\n"
"  drag_teleop_controller/srv/TeleopMode \"{mode: effort}\"\n"
"ros2 service call /drag_teleop_master/teleop_feedback \\\n"
"  drag_teleop_controller/srv/TeleopFeedback \"{mode: position}\"\n"

